  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">PatPatPat 允許玩家撫摸（Shift + 左鍵點擊）已馴服的貓、狼或狐狸（於 1.20.1-1.2.0 版本新增）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">撫摸時：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">被撫摸的生物會點頭、搖尾巴，並發出愉悅輕鬆的聲音，甚至可能小幅恢復生命值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">玩家可能會獲得經驗值。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/708/59/patpatpat.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"374\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">自&nbsp;1.20.X-1.1.0 起，本模組已推出相容的 Spigot 插件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入你的整合包中。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
